        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions Austrian Crystal Bling Door Pulls</b>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis pair (2 door pulls) of First Impressions Bling door pulls are filled with sparkling Austrian crystals and fitted with detailed filigree end brackets adding outstanding harmony to the design.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/omn-mortise-entrance-handleset.jpg?v=1704354592\" width=\"500\" height=\"130\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Austrian Crystals Door Pull\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMade in the USA by the master craftsmen at First Impressions from the finest materials including ultra clear acrylic that allows the Austrian Crystals to show their shimmering beauty. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged with Back to Back mounting (2 door pulls bolted to each other - 1 door pull for each side of a door). Includes lock down threaded rosettes to securely tighten the door pulls to the door.  Also available: Individual <a href=\"/products/decorative-austrian-crystal-pull-first-impressions-atl100swvsbr\"><b>First Impressions Austrian Crystal Bling Door Pull</b></a> for one side of a door.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the First Impressions Atlantic Bling Pull Back-to-Back Pair:\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"Made in the USA\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Material: Clear Acrylic filled with Austrian Crystals</li>\r\n<li>Filigree Bracket Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-PR-ATL100SWV-specifications.pdf?v=1704262302\"><b>First Impressions PR-ATL100SWVSBR Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>PR-ATL100012SWVSBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 9-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>PR-ATL100018SWVSBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 15-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>PR-ATL100024SWVSBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 21-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
